{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44533","headline":"诗三百三首 二百三十 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二百三十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心高如山岳，人我不伏人。\n解讲围陀典，能谈三教文。\n心中无惭媿，破戒违律文。\n自言上人法，称爲第一人。\n愚者皆赞叹，智者抚掌笑。\n阳焰虚空花，岂得免生老。\n不如百不解，静坐绝忧恼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}